{"id":"ebf59bef2c973692","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-formula-size.md","title":"Boolean Formula Size","display":"df-formula-size — Boolean Formula Size","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-formula-size","aliases":["28-df-formula-size","Boolean Formula Size"],"display":"df-formula-size — Boolean Formula Size","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §6.1 discussion of formulas; local exact size convention","source_printed_pages":"108","source_pdf_pages":"134","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-formula-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-formula-size</span><span>Boolean Formula Size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-size — Boolean Formula Size"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §6.1 discussion of formulas; local exact size convention"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"108"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"134"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=(x_1&#39;,\\ldots,x_n&#39;)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x=(x_1&#39;,\\ldots,x_n&#39;)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_x:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\alpha_x:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为下式构造的赋值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tree}\">\\(\\mathrm{tree}\\)</span> 是本节点定义的语法树节点计数标识；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_x\">\\(\\alpha_x\\)</span> 按下式逐坐标唯一构造。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_x(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i&#39;&amp;1\\le i\\le n,\\\\0&amp;i=0\\lor i&gt;n.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_x(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i&#39;&amp;1\\le i\\le n,\\\\0&amp;i=0\\lor i&gt;n.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|x_i|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1,\\quad |\\neg\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1+|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}},\\quad |(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1+|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}+|\\psi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|x_i|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1,\\quad |\\neg\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1+|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}},\\quad |(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1+|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}+|\\psi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FS}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\ \\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\},\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha_x}(\\varphi)=f(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FS}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\ \\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\},\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha_x}(\\varphi)=f(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>公式由带标签树唯一解析，故大小递归唯一。每个布尔函数可用 DNF 表示，常函数可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1\\lor\\neg x_1\">\\(x_1\\lor\\neg x_1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1\\land\\neg x_1\">\\(x_1\\land\\neg x_1\\)</span> 表示，所以最小值集合非空。此处大小计所有语法树节点。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§6.1 discussion of formulas; local exact size convention，印刷页 108；PDF 页 134。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolFml}$、$x_i$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}$、$\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]；$x=(x_1',\\ldots,x_n')\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFml}","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"x=(x_1',\\ldots,x_n')\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_x:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_x(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i'&1\\le i\\le n,\\\\0&i=0\\lor i>n.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"|x_i|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1,\\quad |\\neg\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1+|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}},\\quad |(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\coloneqq1+|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}+|\\psi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FS}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|\\varphi|_{\\mathrm{tree}}:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\ \\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\},\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha_x}(\\varphi)=f(x)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"x_1\\lor\\neg x_1","display":false},{"tex":"x_1\\land\\neg x_1","display":false}],"bytes":2088,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔电路：[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]、[[28-df-formula-size]]。"},{"id":"7e655292323dacd0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，假定 $\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)$，其定义见 [[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]。$\\operatorname{FS}(f)$ 采用 [[28-df-formula-size]]；FS 计所有语法树节点。"}],"outgoing":["b830febc662345bf","2eb3efc252f058f9"]}